## 9. Prompt Engineering Notes

### 10.1 Temperature Settings
- NodeA, NodeB, NodeC: temperature=0.3 (low variance for consistent behavior)
- Topology Planner: temperature=0.5 (slightly more variance for diverse lineages)
- All prompts: request JSON output explicitly

### 10.2 Retry Strategy
